              "LocalizedString": "Restores HP equal to <NumGreen>1000%</> of Akane Rin's Base ATK each time Synced Resonance is cast. Increases her DEF by <NumGreen>50%</> and Resistance to Interruptions by <NumGreen>60%</> for <NumGreen>15</>s."
